###  Installation

#### Step1
Then we start a container mapped to an external volume to store the projects permanently:

    docker run 	-d --name flowise \
			    -v <your local folder>/root/.flowise \
			    -p 8000:3000 flowise
After one or two minutes, you can access flowise in

    http://localhost:8000/



